# Custom 404 & _error.js

* `pages/404.js` – replaces the built‑in 404 page.
* `pages/_error.js` – handles server‑side errors (500, etc.). Receives `statusCode`.

```jsx
// pages/_error.js
function Error({ statusCode }) {
  return (
    <p>
      {statusCode
        ? `An error ${statusCode} occurred on server`
        : 'An error occurred on client'}
    </p>
  );
}
```

These still work perfectly in existing Pages Router projects.

